<title>USA: Hayes Wheels to agree to buy Lemmerz Holding - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Hayes Wheels to agree to buy Lemmerz Holding - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayes Wheels International Inc is expected to announce it has agreed to buy control of European wheel maker, Lemmerz Holding GmbH, for roughly $240 million in stock and cash, plus the assumption of debt, The Wall Street Journal reported Monday.</p>
<p>The story says the transaction solidifies the Romulus, Mich., wheel-maker's position in the global wheel market and reflects the continued consolidation among auto suppliers.</p>
</text>
